@ApmAgentRedisSampleApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5150

GET {{ApmAgentRedisSampleApi_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{ApmAgentRedisSampleApi_HostAddress}}/Redis/GetKey
Accept: application/json

### Create a new trace using elastic agent
GET {{ApmAgentRedisSampleApi_HostAddress}}/Redis/CreateNewTraceAsync
Accept: application/json

### using elastic agent and reuse a existing transaction
GET {{ApmAgentRedisSampleApi_HostAddress}}/Redis/DistributedTrace?orderno="RN100098231"
Accept: application/json